tino before Pitt  in Inglourious Basterds and DiCaprio in  Django Unchained the film will mark Kurt  Russell's third time working with  Tarantino  Sterns ii michael Madsen's forth and  stunt woman and actress Zooey Belle's  six sadly one frequent Tarantino  collaborator apparently ended up on the  cutting room floor Tim Roth who has  appeared in three Tarantino features and  the anthology film four rooms was cast  in the film but did not appear in the  Once Upon a Time in Hollywood caught  Jonah can check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite stuff are  coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the bells so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]

